hey've been married for almost 35 years.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Wow. That's pretty impressive. How are their kids dealing with it?"}, {"time": "47500", "image": "engenn6le10ob02re2img09.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Not well, but they've all started their own families.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Well, I am certainly going to keep my future family a nuclear family.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Yeah, I will NOT end up being a single parent.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Or do what John and Sandra are planning: form a childless family."}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}], "type": "lab_options"}]}], "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "A Quick Coffee Break"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Unbelievable"}, {"type": "position", "content": 2}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 10}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.1"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Describe routines and regular activities in a wider range of social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_9", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}], "type": "objectives"}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn6le10ob02re1img01.jpg"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to spare"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to give something, such as time, money to someone"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Sally asked Peter to spare some time for a coffee break."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le10ob02aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use when you talk about families."}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "divorce"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "when a couple decides to end their marriage and live separately"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Sally found out that her aunt and uncle are getting a divorce."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le10ob02aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "extended family"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a family that includes parents, children and other relatives "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Sally is very close to her extended family."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le10ob02aud03"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "nuclear family"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a family that includes only the father, mother, and children"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Peter said his family will always be a nuclear family."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le10ob02aud04"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "single parent"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "an unmarried person who has a child or children"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Sally doesn't want to be a single parent."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le10ob02aud05"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to end up "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to reach or come to a place or situation that was not expected"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: She did not want to end up raising a child by herself."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le10ob02aud06"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Talking about the Future"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use both <span class=\"italic\">going to </span> and <span class=\"italic\">will</span> to talk about the future."}, {"type": "text", "content": "When you talk about a things that are not decided or when you make a decision at the moment of speaking for the future, you use the modal <span class=\"italic\">will</span>.<br><br>When you ask about intentions, you use <span class=\"italic\">going to</span>."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Structure\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Situation\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Meaning\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"will\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Sally says to Peter on the phone: <span class=\\\"italic\\\">\u201cI'll see you at the espresso bar in 5 minutes.\u201d</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Sally and Peter has just agreed on a plan with Peter.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"going to\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Two minutes later, Sally tells Vanessa on the phone:  <span class=\\\"italic\\\"> \u201cI'm going to have coffee with Peter.\u201d</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Sally tells Vanessa the coffee plan has been been made. \\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "My aunt and uncle are going to get a divorce."}, {"type": "example", "content": "I will be rich and famous, like my grandfather."}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "What have you done? "}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use Wh- questions in <span class=\"strong\">PRESENT PERFECT</span> to ask about the state of a person from a specific time or epoch in the past until the present. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Form: </span><br> <br><span class=\"strong\">Wh</span> + auxiliary + subject + verb in past participle + complement? <br> <span class=\"strong\">What</span> <br> <span class=\"strong\">Where</span> <br> <span class=\"strong\">When</span> + have (I/you/they/we)<br> <span class=\"strong\">Why</span> + <span class=\"strong\">has</span> (he/she)<br> <span class=\"strong\">How long</span><br> <span class=\"strong\">How</span>"}, {"type": "example", "content": "How long <span class=\"strong\">have</span>  they <span class=\"strong\">been</span>  married? "}, {"type": "example", "content": "How <span class=\"strong\">have</span>  the kids <span class=\"strong\">been</span> ? "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Where <span class=\"strong\">have</span>  you <span class=\"strong\">had</span> the coffee break this week?"}, {"type": "example", "content": "What <span class=\"strong\">has</span>  she <span class=\"strong\">read</span>  lately?"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Choose one Latin country, one European country, and  Asian country to research."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Find out how the average family size in a home."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Are extended family included?"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Fill the information into the following chart."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">Country\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">Average family size\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\"> Extended family in home: (Y / N)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I research types of families in other cultures."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I determine average family sizes."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I organize my research information into a table."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I communicate the information to my partner."}]}]}